SCHEDULE (parámetros que deciden las optimizaciones; ver tfm_pruebas/README.md)
  fijado  [k_matmul_9cff3e__partial] WORK=  TILE=  STAGE=  REDUCE=  RASTER=
  fijado  [k_matmul_9cff3e] WORK=  REDUCE=  RASTER=
  greedy  [k_matmul_9cff3e] WORK=w1x2  TILE=mma_m16n8k16_f16_f16/f1x2/k8  STAGE=d4/smem-tma  REDUCE=  RASTER=
  interruptores: FAST_MATH=True, FAST_EXP=True, F16_MMA_F32_ACC=True, FP8_MMA=True
